{
  "info": {
    "name": "API de Loja - Projeto Final",
    "description": "Coleção de testes da API (Semana 8).\n\n1. Ajuste a variável **baseUrl** (local: http://localhost:3000 ou a URL do deploy).\n2. Preencha **adminSenha** com a ADMIN_SENHA configurada no servidor.\n3. Rode a coleção inteira (Run collection) na ordem: sucesso → erros → limpeza.\n\nPela linha de comando: `npx newman run docs/postman/api-loja.postman_collection.json --env-var adminSenha=...`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Fluxos de sucesso",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check (acordar a API)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"API ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastro (POST /register)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailUsuario\", `ana.${Date.now()}@email.com`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const u = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Perfil comum e sem senha na resposta\", () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(u.perfil).to.eql(\"comum\");",
                  "  pm.expect(u).to.not.have.any.keys(\"senha\", \"senha_hash\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"usuarioId\", u.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Ana Souza\",\n  \"email\": \"{{emailUsuario}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{senhaUsuario}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
